\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Level-one data flow: option rendering, debate state, claim decomposition, domain routing, verifier labels, simplex trust update, one-shot injection, and weighted aggregation.}}{12}{figure.3.2}%
